&P258631 = BE 06/1, 047 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _e2_ e-da-kum ma-la ma-s,u2-u2 
#tr.ts: bīt eda(k)kum mala maṣû
#tr.en: A wing (of a house) as much as there is
2. _ki_ ri-ba-tum _lukur {d}utu_ 
#tr.ts: itti ri(b)batum nadīt šamaš
#tr.en: from Ribbatum nadītu of Šamaš
3. _dumu-munus_ ip-qa2-tum 
#tr.ts: mārat ipqatum
#tr.en: daughter of Ipqatum,
4. {disz}i3-li2-ma-a-bi 
#tr.ts: ilīma-abī
#tr.en: Ilīma-abī,
5. _dumu_ ARAD-ku-bi 
#tr.ts: mār warad-kubi
#tr.en: son of Warad-kubi,
6. _e2?_ a-na ki-is,-ri a-na _mu 1(disz)-kam_-szu 
#tr.ts: bītam ana kiṣrī ana ištēt šattīšu
#tr.en: the house, against payment of rent for one (lit. his) year,
7. u2-sze-s,i2 
#tr.ts: ušēṣi
#tr.en: has rented.
8. ki-is,-ri _mu 1(disz)-kam_-szu 
#tr.ts: kiṣrī šattīšu
#tr.en: (As) yearly rental,
@reverse 
1. _5/6(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar i3-la2-e_ 
#tr.ts: parasrab šiqil kaspam išaqqal
#tr.en: he will pay 150 grains of silver.
2. re-esz15 ki-is,-ri 
#tr.ts: rēš kiṣrī
#tr.en: As first installment, (Ribbatum)
3. _1/3(disz) gin2 1(u) 5(disz) sze ku3-babbar_ ma-hi-rum 
#tr.ts: šuššān šiqil ḫamiššer uṭṭet kaspam maḫirum
#tr.en: has received 75 grains of silver.
4. _iti gan-gan-e3-a u4 1(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.ts: waraḫ kislīmim ūmam išten
#tr.en: (In) the month of Kislīmum, on the day 1,
5. i-ru-ub
#tr.ts: i(r)rub
# So CAD (erēbu mng. 1b-2'). Földi reads īrub = has moved in
#tr.en: he will move into.
6. _igi_ nam-ra-am-sza-ru-ur _dumu#_ li-pi2-it-isz8-tar2 
#tr.ts: maḫar narām-šarur mār lipit-ištar
#tr.en: Before Narām-šarur, son of Lipit-ištar;
7. _igi_ sin-ma-gir _dumu_ ga-mi-lim 
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-māgir mār gamilim
#tr.en: before Sîn-māgir, son of Gamilum;
8. _igi_ szu-mu-um-li#-ib-szi#
#tr.ts: maḫar šumum-libši
#tr.en: before Šumum-libši,
9. _dub-sar#_ 
#tr.ts: ṭupšarrum
#tr.en: the scribe.
@left 
1. _mu_ sa-am-su-i-lu-na _lugal-[e?_] 
#tr.ts: šanat samsu-iluna šarrum
#tr.en: The year: “Samsu-iluna the king”.
